{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Independent non-author per-block review receipt: 76/76 PASS. Reviewer session resume-group03-20261023. Immutable before citations and exact Gerrit merged after citations follow. Reviewed candidate 110fa73d2c6f688bc947f48a9b8893fb9457933b and merged 72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62 are byte-identical on all 34 reviewed paths.\n\n```tsv\nticket\tpath\tkind\tblock_id\tbefore_ref\tafter_ref\tpreserved_contract_or_consumer\tdirectives_exact\tbefore_words\tafter_words\tsemantic_preservation\tbloat_removal\treviewer_session\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/alert_dedup.py\tD\tscripts/alert_dedup.py::<module>-d\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/alert_dedup.py:2-22\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/alert_dedup.py:2-8\tPython documentation; Shared dedup for automated CI alert lanes. Both canary and dependency-advisory filers search before filing: each alert tag has at most one open bug. A lane adds at most one marker \tPASS\t188\t62\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/alert_dedup.py\tD\tscripts/alert_dedup.py::find_alert_ticket-d\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/alert_dedup.py:37-42\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/alert_dedup.py:23-23\tPython documentation; Return the one open bug ID for ``tag``, or '' on no match, list error, or parse error.\tPASS\t46\t18\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/alert_dedup.py\tD\tscripts/alert_dedup.py::recent_marker_comment-d\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/alert_dedup.py:62-67\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/alert_dedup.py:43-44\tPython documentation; Return whether ``tid`` has this lane's ``marker`` within ``window_secs``; show/parse errors return False.\tPASS\t43\t13\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/alert_dedup.py\tC\tscripts/alert_dedup.py::comment-4-c\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/alert_dedup.py:83-89\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/alert_dedup.py:60-62\tPython documentation; JSON output carries nanosecond timestamps as exact decimal strings (bug e127). Coerce before type checking or recent markers are missed and both alert lanes can append a comment on\tPASS\t77\t34\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/amend_commit_message.py\tD\tscripts/amend_commit_message.py::<module>-d\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/amend_commit_message.py:2-42\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/amend_commit_message.py:2-9\tPython documentation; Amend HEAD's message from a file while retaining its Gerrit Change-Id. Run ``make amend-msg FILE=<path>``. Plain ``git commit --amend -F`` replaces the message and can stamp a new \tPASS\t391\t75\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/amend_commit_message.py\tD\tscripts/amend_commit_message.py::extract_change_id-d\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/amend_commit_message.py:98-103\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/amend_commit_message.py:64-64\tPython documentation; Return the last Change-Id trailer, the authoritative footer value, or None.\tPASS\t43\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/amend_commit_message.py\tD\tscripts/amend_commit_message.py::extract_sign_offs-d\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/amend_commit_message.py:134-138\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/amend_commit_message.py:94-94\tPython documentation; Return all Signed-off-by trailer values in order; multiple DCO attestations are valid.\tPASS\t37\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/amend_commit_message.py\tD\tscripts/amend_commit_message.py::compose_message-d\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/amend_commit_message.py:143-153\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/amend_commit_message.py:99-101\tPython documentation; Replace file-supplied Change-Ids with HEAD's ``change_id``. Preserve ordered HEAD sign-offs only when the new message supplies none. Let ``git interpret-trailers`` place the traile\tPASS\t87\t23\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/amend_commit_message.py\tC\tscripts/amend_commit_message.py::comment-2-c\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/amend_commit_message.py:59-61\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/amend_commit_message.py:26-27\tPython documentation; Recognize even malformed or mixed-case Change-Id trailers so composition replaces them instead of duplicating them; Gerrit's hook is stricter.\tPASS\t37\t21\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/amend_commit_message.py\tC\tscripts/amend_commit_message.py::comment-4-c\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/amend_commit_message.py:114-117\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/amend_commit_message.py:75-77\tPython documentation; This parameter is opaque to the raw-git lint, but callers use read-only git log/interpret-trailers on the code checkout. raw-git-ok: read-only git helper (git log / interpret-trail\tPASS\t55\t33\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/amend_commit_message.py\tC\tscripts/amend_commit_message.py::comment-5-c\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/amend_commit_message.py:165-168\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/amend_commit_message.py:113-115\tPython documentation; This wrapper owns the code-checkout amend so it retains Change-Id; ticket-store writes still use rebar's supported seams. raw-git-ok: amends the CODE checkout's own HEAD commit mes\tPASS\t63\t33\tPASS\tPASS\tr