3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/build_dc_wiki_corpus.py:39-40\tPython documentation; Map retired vocabulary to canonical spellings during capture; it is irrelevant to Markdown/wiki conversion and tracked fixtures face guards.\tPASS\t61\t21\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/canary_bridge.py\tD\tscripts/canary_bridge.py::<module>-d\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/canary_bridge.py:1-11\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/canary_bridge.py:1-7\tPython documentation; Classify bridge canary alerts outside the workflow YAML. The workflows retain process adapters; tickets-branch delivery lives in ``rebar._store.push``. Alert commands deduplicate b\tPASS\t80\t52\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/canary_bridge.py\tD\tscripts/canary_bridge.py::_previous_canary_red-d\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/canary_bridge.py:93-100\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/canary_bridge.py:83-84\tPython documentation; Return whether the prior completed canary was red and its timestamp. Query errors log and return not-red, delaying heartbeat alert filing until another cycle.\tPASS\t71\t24\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/canary_bridge.py\tC\tscripts/canary_bridge.py::comment-1-c\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/canary_bridge.py:27-34\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/canary_bridge.py:23-25\tPython documentation; Resolve sibling alert_dedup from this file's directory for both direct execution and importlib-loaded tests; avoid reordering an existing sys.path entry (bug 291e-7b48-3f24-41c6).\tPASS\t97\t25\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/canary_bridge.py\tC\tscripts/canary_bridge.py::comment-5-c\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/canary_bridge.py:73-75\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/canary_bridge.py:64-65\tPython documentation; Share open-alert dedup and the 24-hour marker cap with the advisory filer; each lane supplies its own marker.\tPASS\t41\t20\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/canary_bridge.py\tC\tscripts/canary_bridge.py::comment-10-c\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/canary_bridge.py:509-511\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/canary_bridge.py:493-494\tPython documentation; Exit 1 carries expected findings and a JSON report. Exit 2 means the scan failed; treating it as empty could close a live alert.\tPASS\t38\t26\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/canary_bridge.py\tC\tscripts/canary_bridge.py::comment-12-c\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/canary_bridge.py:611-613\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/canary_bridge.py:594-595\tPython documentation; Binding drift persists, so unlike heartbeat alerts it needs no consecutive-red threshold; canary run status carries no drift signal.\tPASS\t36\t21\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/capture_jira_fixtures.py\tD\tscripts/capture_jira_fixtures.py::<module>-d\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/capture_jira_fixtures.py:2-36\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/capture_jira_fixtures.py:2-14\tPython documentation; Capture scrubbed Jira REST payloads for hermetic snapshot tests. With explicit ``REBAR_CAPTURE_JIRA_FIXTURES=1`` and ``JIRA_PROJECT``, read Jira through production ``AcliClient`` m\tPASS\t224\t82\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/capture_jira_fixtures.py\tD\tscripts/capture_jira_fixtures.py::_trim_comments-d\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/capture_jira_fixtures.py:133-139\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/capture_jira_fixtures.py:96-97\tPython documentation; Keep the most recent ``cap`` comments while preserving Jira's other comment-field keys and each retained comment's shape.\tPASS\t50\t17\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/capture_jira_fixtures.py\tC\tscripts/capture_jira_fixtures.py::comment-2-c\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/capture_jira_fixtures.py:47-51\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/capture_jira_fixtures.py:25-26\tPython documentation; A small stable REB set covers nested comments, links (including empty), parent links (including null), and a non-null assignee. Refresh by capture.\tPASS\t62\t24\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/capture_jira_fixtures.py\tC\tscripts/capture_jira_fixtures.py::comment-3-c\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/capture_jira_fixtures.py:65-69\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/capture_jira_fixtures.py:40-41\tPython documentation; Keep only recent comments to bound fixture size, but preserve each ADF body/author/id and the nested comment shape consumed by the differ.\tPASS\t63\t24\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/capture_jira_fixtures.py\tC\tscripts/capture_jira_fixtures.py::comment-4-c\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/capture_jira_fixtures.py:72-83\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/capture_jira_fixtures.py:44-46\tPython documentation; Scrub structured secret fields, then regex-scrub strings for emails and raw or URL-encoded account IDs. Preserve JSON keys and value types so the fixture remains a faithful respons\tPASS\t84\t32\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/check_cli_json_js_safe.py\tD\tscripts/check_cli_json_js_safe.py::<module>-d\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/check_cli_json_js_safe.py:2-46\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/check_cli_json_js_safe.py:2-14\targparse --help; Guard CLI JSON stdout against raw unsafe integers (ticket e127-a3ad-895a-4a2f). Nanosecond store timestamps exceed JavaScript's exact integer range. CLI store data must use ``js_sa\tPA