ume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/check_deploy_manifest.py\tC\tscripts/check_deploy_manifest.py::comment-2-c\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/check_deploy_manifest.py:51-56\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/check_deploy_manifest.py:19-20\tPython documentation; Intentional non-triggering derived paths need a reason and a live file; stale exclusions fail. Add true omissions to autodeploy instead.\tPASS\t63\t22\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/check_deploy_manifest.py\tC\tscripts/check_deploy_manifest.py::comment-4-c\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/check_deploy_manifest.py:97-99\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/check_deploy_manifest.py:61-62\tPython documentation; Read only the quoted value: a trailing shell comment must not become a fake manifest path and mask an uncovered deployment file.\tPASS\t44\t24\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/check_deploy_manifest.py\tC\tscripts/check_deploy_manifest.py::comment-7-c\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/check_deploy_manifest.py:258-260\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/check_deploy_manifest.py:221-222\tPython documentation; A zero-path derivation would pass vacuously after an infra layout change; reject it as a liveness failure.\tPASS\t41\t19\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/check_destructive_test_exec.py\tD\tscripts/check_destructive_test_exec.py::<module>-d\t91c31a4109ec34672aecac76f3ae081bf2e9a20a:scripts/check_destructive_test_exec.py:2-29\t72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:scripts/check_destructive_test_exec.py:2-8\targparse --help; Reject tests that execute shell deletion with an unguarded variable target. An injectable deletion command (such as ``${RM_CMD:-rm}``) lets tests record argv without deleting. A pr\tPASS\t244\t66\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\r\ntaurine-tardy-kite\tscripts/check_